      "q": "1. Match structures in Column I with functions given in Column II.\nColumn I\nColumn II\n(i) Stomata\n(a)\nAbsorption of water\n(ii) Xylem\n(b) Transpiration\n(iii) Root hairs\n(c) Transport of food\n(iv) Phloem\n(d) Transport of water\n(e) Synthesis of carbohydrates",
